# Single source of truth for code ownership in this repository, evaluated by the codeowners-plus action
# (see .github/workflows/codeowner.yml). GitHub's native .github/CODEOWNERS is intentionally left empty.
# See the docs for more information: https://github.com/marketplace/actions/codeowners-plus#codeowners-file-spec
